  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><p>• Brand story :We started with a simple idea:  jewelry should be more than an object.  It should be a keeper of memories,  a witness to your most important moments.  Romalar invites you to wear more than just jewelry.  Wear your story.</p><p><br></p><p>• What makes us different: We use high-quality materials (such as 18K gold plating, high-purity zircon), but remain competitive in price, providing quality and design far beyond that of fast fashion brands.</p><p><br></p><p>• How affiliates can earn:</p><p>1. Basic commission rate: You will receive a 20% sales commission on all valid orders generated through the exclusive alliance link.</p><p>2. Cookie validity period: 30 days. As long as the customer places an order within 30 days after clicking on your link, you can get a commission.</p><p>3. Performance bonus: If the monthly/quarterly sales reach a specific target, an additional 5% bonus can be obtained.</p><p><br></p><p>• Other information:</p><p>Payment cycle and threshold: Commission is paid monthly. When your payable commission reaches $50, we will pay it to you in the following month via [for example: PayPal/bank transfer].</p><p><br></p><p>Support and contact: If you have any questions, please contact us at collaboration@romalarjewelry.com</p></div>",
